      "title": "Guidance stays active",
      "items": [
        "Coding rules apply to source work throughout, including TDD and corrections.",
        "TDD repeats one red/green slice. The local skill puts refactoring in the review stage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Review is not release",
      "items": [
        "Independent review needs Git snapshots, authorized read-only reviewers, and capacity.",
